<main class="zd-beta">

  <section class="zdbeta-hero">
    <div>
      <p class="zdbeta-eyebrow">Beta Access</p>
      <h1>Help test Goal Grower before launch.</h1>
      <p>
        Join the early testing group for Goal Grower. Test shared gardens, goal plants,
        watering, reminders, onboarding, and the full app experience before public release.
      </p>

      <div class="zdbeta-actions">
        <a href="#beta-form">Request Beta Access</a>
        <a href="/pages/community">Join the Community</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zdbeta-grid">
    <article class="zdbeta-card zdbeta-card--wide">
      <span>01</span>
      <h3>Test real features.</h3>
      <p>
        Shared gardens are already available for testing. Your feedback helps make
        Goal Grower clearer, smoother, and more useful before App Store launch.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="zdbeta-card">
      <span>02</span>
      <h3>Find bugs.</h3>
      <p>Report issues with navigation, plant health, reminders, garden sharing, and app flow.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="zdbeta-card zdbeta-card--dark">
      <span>03</span>
      <h3>Shape the product.</h3>
      <p>Suggest improvements and help decide what should be built, fixed, or simplified next.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="zdbeta-card">
      <span>04</span>
      <h3>Support the launch.</h3>
      <p>Help prepare Goal Grower for real users by testing the experience before release.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="zdbeta-process">
    <div class="zdbeta-section-head">
      <p class="zdbeta-eyebrow">How Beta Testing Works</p>
      <h2>A simple testing process.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="zdbeta-process-list">
      <article>
        <span>Step 01</span>
        <h3>Request access.</h3>
        <p>Submit your name, email, device type, and why you want to test Goal Grower.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Step 02</span>
        <h3>Try the app.</h3>
        <p>Use Goal Grower normally: create goals, water plants, and test shared gardens.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Step 03</span>
        <h3>Send feedback.</h3>
        <p>Report bugs, confusing areas, missing features, and things that feel good.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Step 04</span>
        <h3>Help improve launch.</h3>
        <p>Your feedback helps decide what gets polished before the public release.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zdbeta-form-section" id="beta-form">
    <div class="zdbeta-form-copy">
      <p class="zdbeta-eyebrow">Request Access</p>
      <h2>Apply to become a beta tester.</h2>
      <p>
        This form is for people who want to help test Goal Grower while it is still
        being built. Beta access may be limited while the app is being prepared for launch.
      </p>
    </div>

    <form class="zdbeta-form" method="post" action="/contact#beta-form">
      <input type="hidden" name="form_type" value="contact">
      <input type="hidden" name="utf8" value="✓">
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[subject]" value="Goal Grower Beta Access Request">

      <label>
        Name
        <input type="text" name="contact[name]" placeholder="Your name" required>
      </label>

      <label>
        Email
        <input type="email" name="contact[email]" placeholder="you@example.com" required>
      </label>

      <label>
        Device
        <select name="contact[Device]">
          <option>iPhone</option>
          <option>Android</option>
          <option>Both</option>
          <option>Not sure yet</option>
        </select>
      </label>

      <label>
        Why do you want to test Goal Grower?
        <textarea name="contact[Beta reason]" rows="5" placeholder="Tell us what you want to test or why you are interested."></textarea>
      </label>

      <button type="submit">Request Beta Access</button>
    </form>
  </section>

  <section class="zdbeta-cta">
    <p class="zdbeta-eyebrow">Support the Mission</p>
    <h2>Not ready to test? You can still help.</h2>
    <p>
      Support development, share the project, or follow the roadmap as Goal Grower
      moves closer to launch.
    </p>

    <div class="zdbeta-actions">
      <a href="/pages/support">Support Development</a>
      <a href="/pages/roadmap">View Roadmap</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Beta Access Page",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Beta Access Page"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}